  <string-array name="frases_saludo">
    <item>Let\'s light up the day!</item>
    <item>Hi, still burning bright.</item>
    <item>Shall we take a few steps?</item>
  </string-array>
  <string-array name="frases_apagada">
    <item>I\'m fading… shall we walk?</item>
    <item>A few steps and I\'ll glow again.</item>
    <item>We\'ve been still a while. Move?</item>
    <item>I need a little firewood.</item>
    <item>A short walk rekindles me.</item>
  </string-array>
  <string-array name="frases_inquieta">
    <item>I sense tension. Let\'s breathe?</item>
    <item>One minute of air calms us.</item>
    <item>Let\'s slow down, together.</item>
  </string-array>
  <string-array name="frases_tranquila">
    <item>Going well, no rush.</item>
    <item>Burning low and steady.</item>
    <item>A bit more and I\'ll really glow.</item>
    <item>Nice pace. Keep going.</item>
    <item>I like this warmth.</item>
  </string-array>
  <string-array name="frases_feliz">
    <item>Look at you go!</item>
    <item>Watch me shine!</item>
    <item>We\'re almost at the goal.</item>
    <item>Your steps light me up.</item>
    <item>Now that\'s a good fire!</item>
  </string-array>
  <string-array name="frases_euforica">
    <item>Goal reached! I\'m blazing!</item>
    <item>We did it! What a bonfire!</item>
    <item>Today we\'re legends!</item>
    <item>Too much fire to hold!</item>
    <item>A record of sparks!</item>
  </string-array>

